  "goodToKnow": "Einatmen means to breathe in or inhale: tief einatmen, Rauch einatmen. The opposite is ausatmen (to breathe out). Doctors say Bitte tief einatmen... und ausatmen. For medicines and steam, Germans say inhalieren. Durchatmen means to take a deep breath, also figuratively to relax: endlich durchatmen. Separable: atmete ein, eingeatmet."
